### Feature ServiceOrderItems — CREATE (JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
# access_token: npm run dev:token -- admin  (o POST /api/sesion/login desde ISS-15)
@token = pega-aqui-el-access-token

### Agregar línea por unidad a una orden → 201 (recalcula totales)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-ordenes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "service_order_id": 1,
  "laundry_service_id": 6,
  "quantity": 12
}

### Agregar línea por kg → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-ordenes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "service_order_id": 1,
  "laundry_service_id": 2,
  "quantity": 8,
  "weight_kg": 4.2
}
